-RABT_16=Reaper is a set of patches. Everything underneath it, and most of what is good about it, came from other people - many of whom owed this project nothing at all.
-RABT_17=Creator and maintainer of Asuswrt-Merlin, the firmware every line of this build is patched on top of. Reaper is a fork with opinions; this is the thing it has opinions about. Remove him from the picture and there is no picture.
-RABT_18=Compile-integrity guidance, and a bug hunter with a genuinely unsettling hit rate. If a build was going to fall over, he tended to know before the build did.
-RABT_19=The QA department nobody hired, nobody budgeted for, and nobody can now imagine shipping a release without.
-RABT_20=Brought real operational experience to the reporting thread and quietly filtered the noise out of it. Half the value of a bug report is knowing it is a bug.
-RABT_21=Speaks quietly and infrequently. Every single time, it was worth stopping what I was doing to read it.
-RABT_22=Never once let a test build go untested. GT-BE98 owners have working firmware because these two kept flashing it and saying what happened.
-RABT_23=Sole, tireless and remarkably patient ambassador for the RT-BE88U. That model is in far better shape for it.
-RABT_24=Every tester, every screenshot, every "mine does that too". More than one release exists purely because somebody took the time to describe exactly what broke and when - which is a harder and rarer skill than it sounds.
-RABT_25=Genuinely excellent hardware, and plenty of it - a real pleasure to build on. The offer stands, by the way: let's talk global Reaper distribution. You bring the production line, I'll bring the patch series.
-RABT_26=Making wireless great again, one closed-source blob at a time. The silicon is superb and we would love to see more of the source, but we will take the wins we are given.
+RABT_16=Reaper je nabor popravkov. Vse pod njim, in večina tega, kar je pri njem dobrega, prihaja od drugih ljudi - od katerih mnogi temu projektu niso dolgovali prav ničesar.
+RABT_17=Ustvarjalec in vzdrževalec Asuswrt-Merlin, vdelane programske opreme, na kateri je zakrpana vsaka vrstica te gradnje. Reaper je fork z mnenji; to je stvar, o kateri ima mnenja. Odstranite ga s slike in slike ni več.
+RABT_18=Vodenje pri celovitosti prevajanja in lovec na hrošče s prav srhljivo uspešnostjo. Če se je gradnja nameravala zrušiti, je to običajno vedel, preden je to vedela gradnja.
+RABT_19=Oddelek QA, ki ga ni nihče zaposlil, zanj ni nihče namenil proračuna in brez katerega si zdaj nihče ne predstavlja izdaje.
+RABT_20=V nit s poročili je prinesel resnične operativne izkušnje in iz nje tiho odfiltriral šum. Polovica vrednosti poročila o napaki je vedeti, da gre res za napako.
+RABT_21=Govori tiho in redko. Prav vsakič se je splačalo prekiniti delo in prebrati.
+RABT_22=Niti enkrat nista pustila, da bi testna gradnja ostala nepreizkušena. Lastniki GT-BE98 imajo delujočo vdelano programsko opremo, ker sta jo ta dva vztrajno nameščala in sporočala, kaj se je zgodilo.
+RABT_23=Edini, neutrudni in izjemno potrpežljivi ambasador RT-BE88U. Ta model je zaradi tega v precej boljšem stanju.
+RABT_24=Vsak preizkuševalec, vsak posnetek zaslona, vsak "tudi moj to počne". Več kot ena izdaja obstaja zgolj zato, ker si je nekdo vzel čas in natančno opisal, kaj se je pokvarilo in kdaj - kar je težja in redkejša veščina, kot se sliši.
+RABT_25=Resnično odlična strojna oprema, in to veliko nje - pravo veselje je graditi na njej. Mimogrede, ponudba še velja: pogovorimo se o globalni distribuciji Reaperja. Vi prinesete proizvodno linijo, jaz prinesem serijo popravkov.
+RABT_26=Znova dela brezžično omrežje veličastno, en zaprtokodni blob naenkrat. Silicij je vrhunski in radi bi videli več izvorne kode, a vzamemo zmage, ki so nam dane.
